  "body": "To view the property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M15A\r\n\r\nNow priced at just $1,595,000, finding a substantial 261sqm family home with this much space, flexibility and a massive double garage represents exceptional value here in Orewa! Our owners have made a significant price reduction, creating a fantastic opportunity for buyers wanting more home for their money.\r\n\r\nThis former show home offers four to five bedrooms, two bathrooms, multiple living zones and a massive double garage with workshop. There's genuine room here for growing families, teenagers, guests or those working from home.\r\n\r\nSpread across multiple levels, the clever layout gives everyone their own space while still bringing the family together. The central kitchen connects beautifully with the living areas, while fresh neutral tones, excellent natural light and brand-new premium commercial-grade carpet create a lovely modern feel throughout.\r\n\r\nThe primary suite enjoys views towards Orewa and opens to its own private deck, offering a peaceful retreat away from the rest of the home.\r\n\r\nOutside, north-facing entertaining areas capture the sunshine, while a private landscaped patio, spa pool and fully fenced backyard provide plenty of space to relax and enjoy. The oversized double garage with workshop is a real standout, with additional parking for the boat or campervan.\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained and presented, the home combines Linear weatherboard, plastered block and rendered brick construction.\r\n\r\nAnd the location is just as practical! With buses nearby, easy motorway access and Orewa Beach, cafés, shops, the estuary walkway and sports fields all just minutes away, everything you need is close at hand.\r\n\r\nThere's even the option to purchase the home furnished.\r\n\r\nWith such a significant price reduction, 261sqm of living and all this extra space, this is a property that deserves another look!",
